  "job_B3.2.15_20251003_114615": {
    "chunk_text": "ing\u00e6 on \u00feas halg\u00e6n Swa Hieronimus be \u00feam cw\u00e6\u00fe, \u00fe\u00e6t \u00f0\u00e6t f\u00e6sten acl\u00e6nsige \u00fe\u00e6s monnes heortan & \u00feone lichame; & hit Augustinus cw\u00e6\u00f0 \u00fe\u00e6t \u00fea halgan festen beo\u00f0 swy\u00fee stronge flan ongean deofles costung\u00e6, & heom \u00de\u00e6t is to wit\u00e6nne, \u00fe\u00e6t \u00f0a festenu mid o\u00f0re godum dedum beo\u00f0 swi\u00f0e anfencge; & \u00fe\u00e6t fulfremede \u00c6r\u00e6st heo ye\u00f0 \u00f0a andweardan god; & heo gegearuw\u00e6\u00f0 \u00feare synne forgifennesse; & heo & heo alys\u00e6\u00f0 hine from dea\u00fee, & from ece wite; & heo ascyr\u00e6\u00f0 hine from deofl\u00e6n, & heo \u00feud hine to \u00deeo \u00e6lmes is \u00f0reor\u00e6 cynne; an is lichamlic, \u00fe\u00e6t mon \u00feam \u00feearfum sylle \u00fe\u00e6t to gode mage; & \u00fea twa O\u00feer is \u00fe\u00e6t mon forgife \u00feam \u00f0e wi\u00f0 him agylt\u00e6\u00f0. O\u00feer \u00fe\u00e6t mon \u00feone unwis\u00e6n & \u00feone dwelligendan \u00fereage & hine to rihte w\u00e6ge cyrre. Gif we \u00feenne \u00f0as six m\u00e6gnu heald\u00e6\u00fe & heom geornlice lufig\u00e6\u00fe, \u00feone wun\u00e6\u00fe God mid us, & we mid \u00de\u00e6r ne bi\u00f0 nan wi\u00f0erwinn\u00e6, ne nan drefednesse, ne nan unrotnes; ac \u00fe\u00e6r habb\u00e6\u00f0 alle halige AMEN..",
